        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Takes every killer slot when it spawns, and is mutually exclusive with roles such as Jotaro.",
            "zh_cn": "刷新时占满全部杀手名额，并与承太郎等职业互斥。",
            "zh_tw": "刷新時占滿全部殺手名額，並與承太郎等職業互斥。"
