          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "After the match starts, a crack appears at a random suitable empty spot beside a task point every 75 to 112.5 seconds; only the killers can see the crack glowing.",
            "zh_cn": "游戏开局后每过 75 到 112.5 秒，会在任务点旁合适的空位处随机出现一道裂缝，只有杀手能看到裂缝发光。",
            "zh_tw": "遊戲開局後每過 75 到 112.5 秒，會在任務點旁合適的空位處隨機出現一道裂縫，只有殺手能看到裂縫發光。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            2.64,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
