        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "When a killer is born, everyone sees a subtitle and hears a sound. A destruction progress bar sits at the top left of the screen.",
            "zh_cn": "杀手诞生时，所有人都会看到字幕并听到声音。屏幕左上方有破坏进度条。",
            "zh_tw": "殺手誕生時，所有人都會看到字幕並聽到聲音。螢幕左上方有破壞進度條。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            1.8,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Every two minutes one of the following events is drawn at random from the event pool: blackout, position swap, signal interference, time rewind, silence, coin supply, exposure, lockdown or command injection.",
            "zh_cn": "每过两分钟会从事件池内随机抽取以下事件：关灯、换位、信号干扰、时间回溯、缄默、金币补给、曝光、封锁或命令注入。",
            "zh_tw": "每過兩分鐘會從事件池內隨機抽取以下事件：關燈、換位、信號干擾、時間回溯、緘默、金幣補給、曝光、封鎖或命令注入。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            2.08,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
