        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Rewinds save a node one minute before triggering and do not roll back the destruction progress or the role rewrites. The coin supply gives every online player in the event world 25 extra coins, including spectators, and no longer records positions or pulls players back.",
            "zh_cn": "回溯会在触发前一分钟保存节点，不回滚破坏进度和职业改写。金币补给给事件世界内所有在线玩家各增加 25 金币，包括观战玩家，不再记录位置或回拉。",
            "zh_tw": "回溯會在觸發前一分鐘保存節點，不回滾破壞進度和職業改寫。金幣補給給事件世界內所有線上玩家各增加 25 金幣，包括觀戰玩家，不再記錄位置或回拉。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            1.8,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The game only ends when the time runs out, the neutral side wins independently, or the destruction progress reaches its quota.",
            "zh_cn": "游戏只在时间耗尽、中立独立胜利，或破坏进度达标时结束。",
            "zh_tw": "遊戲只在時間耗盡、中立獨立勝利，或破壞進度達標時結束。"
